// Title: Disabling Security Tools
// Rule ID: e3a8a052-111f-4606-9aee-f28ebeb76776
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.004
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_security_tools_disabling.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
